1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,550
Every fund has work that eats the week.

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:05,700
Pulling numbers from filings. Reconciling files.

3
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:08,200
Answering the same question again.

4
00:00:08,490 --> 00:00:09,400
We're Otterd.

5
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:13,200
We build AI workflows around the tools your team already uses.

6
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:15,500
Gather the sources, draft the output,

7
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:18,400
test it with code, and flag exceptions for your review.

8
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,600
Then hand the workflow over to you.

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:24,100
Hiro and Eric are at Greywolf on November 10th and 12th.

10
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,200
Tell us about one recurring task:

11
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:29,550
how often, how long, and what a good result looks like.

12
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:30,900
Choose a lane.

13
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:33,100
Open: public or routine.

14
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:36,100
Filings, company websites, blank templates.

15
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:39,100
Share public or sanitized examples freely.

16
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:42,100
Describe: internal, but not your edge.

17
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:45,700
Admin reports, reconciliations, compliance checklists.

18
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:47,800
Describe the steps and file layout.

19
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:49,200
We'll build on a stand-in.

20
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:51,300
Your team connects the real files.

21
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,250
Keep: your edge.

22
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:55,700
Positions, sizing, P&L.

23
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,300
Your read on a covenant.

24
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:58,800
Why a trade works.

25
00:00:58,970 --> 00:00:59,900
Don't share it.

26
00:01:00,170 --> 00:01:02,950
We can help your team build inside your own environment.

27
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,000
Copy the brief and email it to us by November 6th.

28
00:01:06,170 --> 00:01:09,950
Before the visit, we'll build a first version on public or dummy data.

29
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,000
Busy that week?

30
00:01:11,180 --> 00:01:13,750
We'll leave a three-minute recording and a one-page note.

31
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:14,850
Ten minutes now.

32
00:01:14,970 --> 00:01:16,800
Something concrete when we arrive.
